  "archivedBody": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-648eeec2f19eed4c3dcab5f7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"e4063ed37870f60e0183\" id=\"block-e4063ed37870f60e0183\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>Originally published in </em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Decompression</em></span><em>, Issue 6.</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>“Portrait of a Girl in a Man’s Rainboots” also featured in </em><a href=\"https://www.mikebagwell.me/or-else-they-are-trees\"><em>Or Else they are Trees</em></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-e4063ed37870f60e0183 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-block-type=\"5\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_4914\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          combination-animation-site-default\n          individual-animation-site-default\n          individual-text-animation-site-default\n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n        data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:490px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n              class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n              data-animation-role=\"image\"\n              \n  \n\n          >\n            <div data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image-container class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\n              \n          \n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:66.12245178222656%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg\" data-image-dimensions=\"490x324\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg\" width=\"490\" height=\"324\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/64729d819da3551e36816423/5b05fbe8-49ba-476c-8b29-af2c00002510/spine.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Written Onto</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You are the color of dust piled<br>beneath church frescoes when shadows<br>are more solid than the things they carry.<br><br>In the abandoned house,<br>the flame of a candle closes its tear ducts.<br><br>The freezer drips a blood-like substance,<br>but it is not blood, it is the juice<br>of pomegranates.<br><br>You do not notice and each time you<br>go to pull out the ice cream,<br>another stain crosses your breast.<br><br>Each month a new line,<br>new dust, but you no longer<br>recognize Demeter's script.<br><br>It says only \"woman\"<br>but even that comfort<br>has been denied to you.</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Portrait of a Girl in a Man’s Rainboots</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nothing has seeped into your skin<br>even as you were gathering, note by note,<br>the ocean in your palms.<br><br>Back in the slow country,<br>I took your big, empty boots for a walk<br>and they felt like boats<br>being washed ashore in a storm.<br>It was no longer raining and<br>I thrashed through the underbrush,<br><br>raising my knees into the clouds—<br>each twig-snap like the sound<br>of a nail hammered into a cross—<br>until it grew dark and I reached the point<br>where twigs end and the sky begins.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1687088835422_5891 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
